<title>UK: German inland gas oil slips, buyers hold back.</title>
<headline>German inland gas oil slips, buyers hold back.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6685)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     32.20/32.60     18.59/19.18   32.70/33.20</p>
<p> BREMEN		32.20/32.60     18.95/19.18   32.70/33.20</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    32.40/32.80     19.06/19.30   32.50/32.80</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   32.60/33.00     19.18/19.42   33.00/33.40</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   32.50/32.90     19.12/19.36   33.10/33.50</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  33.30/33.80     19.59/19.89   33.70/34.10</p>
<p>German inland gas oil fell on Thursday, pulled lower by easier gas oil futures and absent demand. &quot;People see the falling prices and are holding back until the market bottoms out,&quot; said one trader. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
</text>
